{"version":1,"content":"<p>Google宣佈，將延長Gemini臨時聊天以及關閉聊天歷史記錄情況下對話數據的保存時間。從原先最長72小時提升至約兩個月。該調整將在未來數周內逐步向全球Gemini應用用户推出。Google表示，此舉旨在隨着人工智能系統能力不斷增強，進一步提昇平台的安全性和可靠性。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1586834.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T21:00:38.638290+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":139,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T20:36:27+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T20:53:53.290522+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T20:53:53.290522+00:00","content_hash":"5b6426ea4a98d1e284e884db71e501000ec0a71adb406e2b447869e534f02149","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}